{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":9,"lang":"id","title":"Yang sedang terjadi","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Apa yang akan kamu pelajari","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Di pelajaran 6 kamu bercerita tentang hal yang rutin: I work, she cooks. Sekarang tentang yang sedang terjadi saat ini, di depan matamu: «aku sedang mengamati burung», «esnya sedang mencair», «dia tidak sedang mencicipi selai»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Aku sedang mengamati burung.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"The ice is melting.","translation":"Esnya sedang mencair.","hi":"is melting"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Dia tidak sedang mencicipi selai.","hi":"is not tasting"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"Ritsletingnya berfungsi?","hi":"Is"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"Penjepit + kegiatan dengan -ing","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita cukup pakai «sedang»: «aku sedang menonton». Bahasa Inggris perlu dua bagian: am, is, atau are, dan -ing di akhir kegiatan. I am watching. Kurang satu bagian — salah: I watching atau I am watch."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am observing the birds.","translation":"Aku sedang mengamati burung.","hi":"am observing"},{"en":"She is watching a caterpillar.","translation":"Dia sedang melihat ulat.","hi":"is watching"},{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Mereka sedang memakai kaca pembesar.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"I am knocking at the door.","translation":"Aku sedang mengetuk pintu.","hi":"am knocking"},{"en":"A visitor is waiting.","translation":"Seorang tamu sedang menunggu.","hi":"is waiting"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I watching a caterpillar.","right":"I am watching a caterpillar."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"She watching a caterpillar.","right":"She is watching a caterpillar."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"She","after":"watching a caterpillar.","options":["is","are","—"],"answer":"is","why":"Sebelum kegiatan dengan -ing harus ada penjepit; dengan she — is."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"Penjepitnya sama seperti pelajaran 1","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Penjepit mana yang dipakai ditentukan oleh «siapa», seperti di awal kursus. I — am; he, she, it, dan satu benda — is; you, we, they — are: I am sighing, the ice is melting, we are marching."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am sighing with relief.","translation":"Aku sedang menarik napas lega.","hi":"am"},{"en":"He is sneezing.","translation":"Dia sedang bersin.","hi":"is"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"Kunang-kunangnya sedang menyala.","hi":"is"},{"en":"We are marching.","translation":"Kami sedang berbaris.","hi":"are"},{"en":"The leaves are whirling.","translation":"Daun-daunnya sedang berputar.","hi":"are"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"We is marching.","right":"We are marching."}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"Cara menulis -ing","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Biasanya -ing langsung ditambahkan: watch → watching. Kalau kata berakhir dengan e yang tidak dibaca, e dibuang: make → making. Kalau berakhir dengan vokal pendek dan satu konsonan, konsonannya digandakan: sit → sitting, hop → hopping."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am making my portfolio.","translation":"Aku sedang menyusun portofolioku.","hi":"making"},{"en":"I am sitting.","translation":"Aku sedang duduk.","hi":"sitting"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Aku sedang menyerahkan tugasku.","hi":"submitting"},{"en":"The sparrow is hopping.","translation":"Burung pipitnya sedang melompat.","hi":"hopping"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am makeing my portfolio.","right":"I am making my portfolio."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I am","after":".","options":["siting","sitting","sit"],"answer":"sitting","why":"sit punya vokal pendek dan satu konsonan, jadi t digandakan."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"«Tidak» — not sesudah penjepit","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bilang «tidak sedang» atau «sedang tidak». Bahasa Inggris menaruh not tepat sesudah am, is, are: I am not guessing, she is not tasting the jam. Kegiatan dengan -ing tetap sama."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"am / is / are","accent":true},{"text":"not","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan + ing","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I am not guessing.","translation":"Aku tidak sedang menebak.","hi":"not"},{"en":"She is not tasting the jam.","translation":"Dia tidak sedang mencicipi selai.","hi":"not"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"Mereka tidak sedang melihat.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The wax is not melting.","translation":"Lilinnya tidak meleleh.","hi":"not"},{"en":"The drummer is not marching.","translation":"Penabuh drumnya tidak berbaris.","hi":"not"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I not guessing.","right":"I am not guessing."},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."},{"wrong":"They are not look.","right":"They are not looking."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"spot_slip","kind":"spot_slip","chips":["She","doesn't","tasting","the","jam"],"answerIndex":1,"hint":"Ada satu kata yang tidak cocok. Ketuk kata itu.","fix":"Dengan -ing, «tidak» adalah is not: She is not tasting the jam."}}]},{"num":"06","title":"Pertanyaan: penjepit di depan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bertanya tanpa mengubah urutan. Bahasa Inggris memindahkan am, is, are ke depan, seperti di pelajaran 2: Is the ice melting? Are you inspecting the seam? Do dan does tidak dipakai di sini."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"Am / Is / Are","accent":true},{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan + ing","accent":false},{"text":"?","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Are you inspecting the seam?","translation":"Kamu sedang memeriksa jahitannya?","hi":"Are"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"Dia sedang memeriksa lapisan dalamnya?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the zipper working?","translation":"Ritsletingnya berfungsi?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is he sighing?","translation":"Dia sedang mendesah?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"Is the chocolate melting?","translation":"Cokelatnya sedang meleleh?","hi":"Is"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You are inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"},{"wrong":"Do you inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Tanyakan: «Cokelatnya sedang meleleh?»","answer":["Is","the","chocolate","melting"],"distractors":["Does","melt"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"Sedang atau biasanya?","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"I wear a sweatshirt — «aku biasa pakai sweter» (umumnya). I am sweating — «aku sedang berkeringat» (sekarang). Kita membedakan dengan «biasa» dan «sedang»; bahasa Inggris dengan -ing atau tanpa -ing."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I wear a sweatshirt.","translation":"Aku biasa pakai sweter. *(umumnya)*","hi":"wear"},{"en":"I am sweating.","translation":"Aku sedang berkeringat. *(sekarang)*","hi":"am sweating"},{"en":"The firefly is glowing now.","translation":"Kunang-kunangnya sedang menyala.","hi":"is glowing"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am usually wearing a sweatshirt.","right":"I usually wear a sweatshirt."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Saat ini es di tangga sedang mencair. Kamu bilang apa?","optionA":"The ice melts.","optionB":"The ice is melting.","correct":"B","explain":"Terjadi sekarang, jadi is melting."}}]},{"num":"08","title":"Sesuatu terjadi — dan di mana","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Mudah menambahkan di mana: She is in the doorway. I am near the carousel. Ini penjepit biasa dengan tempat — tanpa -ing, karena tidak ada kegiatan."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"She is in the doorway.","translation":"Dia di ambang pintu.","hi":"is"},{"en":"I am near the carousel.","translation":"Aku di dekat komidi putar.","hi":"am"},{"en":"She is murmuring to the baby.","translation":"Dia sedang berbisik pada bayi.","hi":"is murmuring"},{"en":"My hands are trembling.","translation":"Tanganku sedang gemetar.","hi":"are trembling"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I am being near the carousel.","right":"I am near the carousel."}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Kesalahan yang dibuat hampir semua orang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I watching a caterpillar.","right":"I am watching a caterpillar."},{"wrong":"I am observe the birds.","right":"I am observing the birds."},{"wrong":"The leaves is whirling.","right":"The leaves are whirling."},{"wrong":"I am siting.","right":"I am sitting."},{"wrong":"I not guessing.","right":"I am not guessing."},{"wrong":"You are inspecting the seam?","right":"Are you inspecting the seam?"},{"wrong":"She doesn't tasting the jam.","right":"She is not tasting the jam."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"«Sedang» dalam bahasa Inggris punya dua bagian yang selalu bersama: am / is / are dan -ing. Kalau ada satu, cari yang lain."}]},{"num":"10","title":"Bekal untuk latihan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Sedang — am / is / are + kegiatan dengan -ing. «Tidak» — not sesudah penjepit. Bertanya — penjepit di depan. Tulis dengan teliti: making, sitting, hopping. Kebiasaan — seperti pelajaran 6, tanpa -ing."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"They are using a magnifier.","translation":"Mereka sedang memakai kaca pembesar.","hi":"are using"},{"en":"They are not looking.","translation":"Mereka tidak sedang melihat.","hi":"not"},{"en":"Is she inspecting the lining?","translation":"Dia sedang memeriksa lapisan dalamnya?","hi":"Is"},{"en":"I am submitting my work.","translation":"Aku sedang menyerahkan tugasku.","hi":"submitting"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"02","3":"02","4":"02","5":"02","6":"02","7":"02","8":"02","9":"05","10":"05","11":"05","12":"05","13":"05","14":"05","15":"05","16":"05","17":"06","18":"06","19":"06","20":"06","21":"06","22":"06","23":"06","24":"06","25":"07","26":"07","27":"07","28":"07","29":"07","30":"07","31":"07","32":"07","33":"04","34":"04","35":"04","36":"04","37":"04","38":"04","39":"04","40":"04","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"08","50":"08","51":"08","52":"08","53":"08","54":"08","55":"08","56":"08"}}
